cloudscraper's native interpreter: evaluate number literals from ast.Constant

ast.NodeVisitor no longer routes Constant nodes to the deprecated visit_Num
compatibility shim, so Calc has no handler for a number literal, generic_visit
returns None for it, and every expression the Cloudflare challenge asks the
native interpreter to evaluate fails as "unsupported operand type(s) for *:
'NoneType' and 'NoneType'".

--- a/cloudscraper/interpreters/native.py
+++ b/cloudscraper/interpreters/native.py
@@ -33,6 +33,11 @@ class Calc(ast.NodeVisitor):
 
     # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
 
+    def visit_Constant(self, node):
+        return node.value
+
+    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
+
     def visit_Expr(self, node):
         return self.visit(node.value)
 
